Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars and reach for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky I believe in tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby,\Nalways share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see or to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought on by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on let's go everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh as we chase we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens, my heart is a flutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel I might do\Nanything Luffy asks of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I acquiesce without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't regret it,\Nnot even the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they call love. Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it has a hold on your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It will squeeze and squeeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you fall over dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cannot be with the one you desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The empresses that came before\Nyou all fell in love with men as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:03:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,well but as They were unable to\Nleave their kingdom they were forced
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to bottle up their Feelings while\Nthey stayed their heartache grew
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and grew until the pain Was so\Ngreat that they died from sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Little did you know that by\Nagreeing to his request you may have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,saved your Own life although you\Nwere struck with love sickness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If Luffy had not arrived, and\Nrequested this very thing, you would
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,have lost your title as warlord\Nand led this kingdom to ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However one may say that\Nhe is just as fortunate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,as you after all had fate\Nnot brought him to this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Island the only way he\Ncould hope to enter that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,prison would be in chains\Njust like his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he wasn't leaving the kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,until tomorrow though I\Nheard there was a last
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,minute Change of plans now he's getting on\Na navy ship along with a snake princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:03:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back to visit and\Nbring my friends next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all guys except Nami and Robin\Nbut it's no fun if we can't all visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if men are forbidden here I\Nthink they'll make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess seems\Nto favor you so it's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,not likely that they would\Nbe sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well probably not at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's our empress now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who had the audacity to place\Nthese beasts in my path?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Detestable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Peacefully adorable obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was half the sexiest, sir, I'd\Nspend all day in front of a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's even more striking than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think that was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.28,0:04:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept full responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, looks like you're feeling all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to be rude but we\Ngotta hurry snake lady
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't look him in the eye it's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rude Luffy you can't call her snake\Nlady it's snake princess don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can simply call me\Nhancock if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool whatever works for\Nyou hammock it's a hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess just smiled at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a diamond snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the stars in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dazzled!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The spark of a woman in love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me long for the\Nsweet days of my youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Granny Young?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is looking rather grotesque!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, snake princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you guarantee that you'll\Nhonor the promise you made earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I contacted my superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we're quick about\Nit, we can stop by Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To be clear, only you\Nand your snake may board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,unless they're shackled\Npirates are not welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At the prison they'll watch you like a hawk\Nwhatever you do please try to stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike down all who oppose\Nyou sister good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,in the battle with white\Nbeard snake princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy i hope you i shall return\Nsoon guard the kingdom in my absence
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm glad I stuck around.\NI feared I might have to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to headquarters of failure it would\Nbe shameful to show up at navy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,headquarters in this unsightly state
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,they are alive aren't they awaken
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,huh what happened get ready for\Ndeparture yes sir right away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make a stop at Impel Down\Nbefore we return to Marineford
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku we have\Nword from Vice Admiral Momonga
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess Boa\NHancock came to speak with
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,them again She finally\Nagreed to our conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told that they're\Non their way now. It's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,About time. Let's just\Nhope they're not late?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman is quite formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll have six of the\Nseven warlords with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And the seventh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did a little time in prison cool his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he's ready to\Naid in our fight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:08:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as before, he's\Nadamantly refusing to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He went so far as to say he would\Nrelinquish his title as warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Given his disposition,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I had assumed that he would be\Nthe most cooperative of the bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the time to\Nget hung up on principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you, Team Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a small issue with the 500 pirates\Nthat Admiral Kizaru captured at Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, the staff had\Nimpelled down so they can't hold them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Send them to a labor camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, if it doesn't\Nhave to do with Whitebeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't have time for it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, sir, but St.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Roswald is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the admirals handle it for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And where the hell is Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I already informed you, sir, but he\Nleft for Impel Down quite some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should expect that kind\Nof behavior from that old bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but not before a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's ship is advancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume the guard ships are on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather speak to them directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost contact, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,with all 23 Navy vessels keeping tabs on\NWhitebeard's main ship, the Moby Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Given the circumstances, we can only\Nconclude they were eliminated by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely not the whole fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been some worrying activity from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,other pirate ships in\Nthe New World as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Without guard ships,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we won't have any idea how many ships the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,enemy is sending or\Nwhen he's sending them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've arranged for replacements,\Nbut we're in the dark right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been had.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think they would act so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Until new ships are in\Nplace, we're flying blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Ace is there, they may even\Nhave the audacity to strike Impel down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So be ready for anything! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, it will be right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, mess boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You still breathing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long ago, only a few\Ndays before, in fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,young lady young lady who came\NPlummeting out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you've\Ncalmed down a little now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No more inclinations toward violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This may look like ordinary rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But they are in fact\Ntightly wound wind knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I untie one, It\Ncreates a gentle breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I untie two, A\Nstrong gust will blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I untie three, It becomes a gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I just thought it\Nmight cheer you up, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I'm real cheery now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a small sky\Nisland called Weatheria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We conduct studies of\Nthe weather here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a sky island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And so Nami found herself on\Na small island in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Will she ever be able to find\Nher way back to her friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My dog, he thought you were\Nsomething we're hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no biggie. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like this guy doesn't even care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one problem, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck am I,\Nand how did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have the sun here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only wearing\Nunderwear in all the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did bandits steal your pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you put on this fur pelt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a fur pelt? No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to maintain a style here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd cramp my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I gotta move, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake your hips to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right hand to the waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And then stick out your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now slide and reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now repeat after me, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two, right,\Nleft, right, left, top!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I know something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Futureland Baltimore,\Nwhich is located on Mechanical Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Peachy Island, a dreamy,\Nbeautiful destination on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the animals and people who\Ncome to this land share a common bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what forms their bodies\Ntake, they still have girlish hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it, I think this was heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone, you weirdos!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As I already told you, I'm\Nnot into that kind of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My dearest Nami, my sweet\NRobin, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How are the two of you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me, I'm, well, uh, how to put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Kamabaka Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a flower blossoming\Nin the middle of the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we now arrive at the Bowen Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rather energetic today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna eat that are you kidding but\Nyou saved my life so you can eat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever you want thank you whoever you\Nare my name is heracleson wow that's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,a pretty cool name you got there\Nreally think so i'm Usopp nice to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you oh is this thing edible i've\Nnever seen this kind of fruit before
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Usoppun. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, you can call me Periclesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard you the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it definitely smells\Ndelicious, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just give it a little lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Usoppun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that thing a plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And did it really just try to eat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, they are man-eating\NGlanston. Man-eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Swindling Forest,\NGlanston. Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, our magic incantation\Nactually worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dreadful looking creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what we've waited for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our prayers are answered!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have our revenge at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have anything left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The long arm tribe took everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bastards laid claim to\Neverything we hold dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great and powerful Satan! Please\Ngrant us our wish in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We are prepared to offer\Nour souls up to you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them bloody and begging for death
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place how far have I been\Ncarried away from all of my two friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.44,0:18:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever their plight I must aid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return to meet the\Nothers at once. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go back to\Nhell yet, Master Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.28,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Offer him more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What could we possibly\Noffer, Master Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be so kind as\Nto show me your panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to see your underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone show him your underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tequila Wolf is a nation of laborers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul! Paul!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The people we have constantly\Ntoiling away to build
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,this bridge are criminals\Nfrom all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Either that or they're\Ncitizens of countries
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that refuse to ally with\Nthe world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,On your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, they're slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer until\Nthe bridge is complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea, but it's been under\Nconstant construction for 700 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,700?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.87,0:19:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But for what purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to concern\Nyourself with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,we're putting you to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so the only thing you need to\Nworry about is making the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where the heck did\Nthese birds go from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about trying to eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's too stiff to get up and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over now, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare to get raccoon on an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoon hotpot! Stop it! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, guess we have reindeer hotpot then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, did reindeer\Njust say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is known as Birdie Kingdom,\Na place where birds reign supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,One legend suggests that its lands\Nare filled with hidden treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but all Chopper has found his danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to travel anywhere in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I would want to go someplace dark\Nand damp with a creepy old castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and I would spend all my days\Nsinging songs of curses, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.86,0:21:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,stupid Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know the castle wouldn't have\Nany maids, no servants, nothing cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,no bagel sandwiches and hot chocolate\Nserved to be in bed every morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and to top it off there isn't\Na single stuffed animal here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,where in the heck am I,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:22:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Kuma C, I miss you. I want to\Ngo back to Thriller Park again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else was exiled here just like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope it's someone cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.37,0:22:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma must have beaten him\Nand launched him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, he looks pretty dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I and why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.04,0:23:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, don't scream like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do with my swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.82,0:23:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you won't be getting those back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, I'm just super awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we return to the present, where\NLuffy is steadily speeding over the waves?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.12,0:23:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to the great prison Impel Down\Nto rescue his brother Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times must I repeat myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are my instructions too complicated\Nto penetrate that thick head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I require at least 100\Nkilos of food per meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything less than that is\Ncompletely insufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be turned to stone again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.44,0:24:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.98,0:24:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring her another meal to her\Nspecifications to replace this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.80,0:24:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.60,0:24:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone ever tries to peek into\Na room, this is what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.08,0:24:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Open wide for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.32,0:24:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply delectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.28,0:24:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you're the one feeding it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it makes it all the sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.86,0:24:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, that's exactly what he would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.88,0:25:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.32,0:25:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to eat something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This Sea King has unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.64,0:25:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.08,0:25:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more than satisfied, just as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.34,0:25:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,can't eat another bite that was so good
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.48,0:25:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,quiet don't forget\Nyou're a stowaway if you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.48,0:25:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,don't keep it down you'll be found excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.02,0:25:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,me is someone else in\Nyour room with you oh
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,damn it lieutenant stalker are you certain
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.82,0:25:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,about this yes sir i\Njust heard someone say
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.86,0:25:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,oh i couldn't eat\Nanother bite and i hardly
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.62,0:25:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,think that the empress\Nwould say that to you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right she'd never say that and if she\Ndid I'll give myself a mohawk same here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.20,0:26:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Um I couldn't eat another bite
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.26,0:26:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There I'm finished for\Nnow take these plates away
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.28,0:26:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, and don't forget, I require\Nthe same amount five times every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.92,0:26:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we give you that much,\Nhow are we supposed to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.84,0:26:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I don't care if\Nyou all starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.36,0:26:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.90,0:26:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, she's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.34,0:26:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There are now only six days left until\Nthe public execution of Portgas V. Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.04,0:26:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,With their guard ships destroyed\Nat the hands of Whitebeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.06,0:26:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tensions at Navy Headquarters are rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.66,0:26:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Famous Marines from all over the world\Nare gathering at the harbor of Marineford,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.82,0:26:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,prepared to battle to\Nthe death, if need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.82,0:27:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of justice,\Nthey ready their swords,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.22,0:27:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,not for any mere battle, but for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.78,0:27:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in the holy land of Marijwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.88,0:27:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the seven warlords are\Nsummoned for a meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to determine their roles in the\Nevent that Whitebeard attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.12,0:27:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Profumes that they are, however, they\Nhave little taste for the discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.80,0:27:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The mood in the room is tense,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.08,0:27:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and all hopes for teamwork\Nor any sort of organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.72,0:27:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,are quickly put to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.86,0:27:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you, Navy Headquarters is...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.56,0:27:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, all of the world government is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.16,0:28:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.48,0:28:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.90,0:28:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want to die, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.42,0:28:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You damned fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.38,0:28:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can be done now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.78,0:28:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.46,0:28:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you were to die right now, that\Nwon't stop Whitebeard from fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.62,0:28:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can\Nstop that anymore, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.34,0:28:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the Navy has made\Nthe king of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.14,0:28:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.58,0:28:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
